#documents — most docs/ is local scratch (plans, brainstorms),
# but we explicitly track deployment + review docs so they survive across machines.
# NOTE: use `docs/*` (not `docs/`) so re-includes below actually work — git
# won't recurse into a directory that itself is excluded.
docs/*
!docs/deployment/
!docs/code-review/
